---
import { BaseHead } from "@components/seo";
import Layout from "@layouts/layout.astro";
---

<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="About – Rabia Ahmed"
    description="Get to know Rabia Ahmed – product marketer, builder and storyteller."
    image="/images/ogimage.png"
  />
</head>

<Layout>
  <section
    class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-white to-amber-100 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-amber-950/30 pt-32 sm:pt-40 pb-20"
  >
    <div
      aria-hidden
      class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-1/4 -translate-y-1/2 h-[720px] w-[720px] opacity-60 blur-3xl dark:opacity-35 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-200/70 via-amber-100/50 to-yellow-100/40"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      aria-hidden
      class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-320px] left-0 h-[620px] w-[620px] opacity-50 blur-3xl dark:opacity-30 bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-200/60 via-amber-100/50 to-yellow-100/40"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"
      >
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-200/70 bg-white/60 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-amber-900 shadow-sm backdrop-blur dark:border-amber-400/40 dark:bg-amber-200/10 dark:text-amber-100"
          >
            About Rabia
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p class="text-lg font-medium text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100">
              Hi! I’m Rabia.
            </p>
            <h1
              class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
            >
              Product Marketer, Web Marketer, and Your Customer’s Seat at the
              Table
            </h1>
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Thanks for stopping by. I’m on a mission to show the world that
            product marketers with non-traditional backgrounds make big impacts.<br
            /><br />
            Running a digital marketing agency along with my experience in SEO, CX,
            web and general marketing positions me to be an astute product marketer.
            My fresh MBA doesn’t hurt either. Excited to share my ideas and insights
            with you!
          </p>
          <div
            class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-100/80 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-sm backdrop-blur dark:border-amber-300/30 dark:bg-slate-900/70"
          >
            <p
              class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100"
            >
              Also a product marketer or career pivoter?
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              Join me on my journey via my weekly newsletter, Astray thoughts.👇
            </p>
            <div
              class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4"
            >
              <a
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-theme-sun-primary dark:text-theme-moon-bgAccent text-black px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-amber-700/20 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-amber-800 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700 dark:bg-theme-sun-primary dark:shadow-amber-500/20 dark:hover:bg-amber-300"
                href="mailto:biaahmedy@gmail.com?subject=Astray%20Thoughts%20Newsletter&body=Hi%20Rabia%2C%20I%E2%80%99d%20love%20to%20join%20your%20newsletter!"
              >
                Get Astray Thoughts
              </a>
              <a
                class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900 underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-100 dark:hover:text-amber-200"
                href="https://linkedin.com/in/biaahmed"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
              >
                Connect on LinkedIn ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative lg:justify-self-end">
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 -left-6 -right-6 -bottom-8 rounded-[32px] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-200/60 via-amber-100/40 to-yellow-100/30 blur-2xl dark:from-amber-500/20 dark:via-amber-400/10 dark:to-slate-900"
            aria-hidden
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-white/70 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-amber-200/40 ring-1 ring-amber-100/80 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:shadow-amber-800/40 dark:ring-amber-900/40"
          >
            <img
              alt="Rabia smiling and chatting at a conference"
              class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"
              src="/images/people/rabia-ahmed.jpg"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-20">
    <!-- radial flare -->
    <div
      aria-hidden
      class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/3 w-[1000px] h-[800px]
                opacity-0 dark:opacity-35
                [background-image:radial-gradient(theme(colors.gray.500),transparent_50%)]"
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert"
    >
      <p>
        It’s not enough to have a great product — someone has to translate its
        brilliance into something users can feel. That’s where I come in.
      </p>

      <p>
        I help early-stage teams bridge the gap between what they’ve built and
        the people who’ll care about it. That often means jumping in before the
        strategy exists — mapping user flows, rewriting onboarding, shaping GTM
        and quietly fixing the friction no one’s named yet.
      </p>

      <p>
        It’s equal parts research, pattern recognition and storytelling — three
        things I’ve spent years practicing.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10">Here’s what I rely on most:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Observe what’s not working.</strong> (Ask questions, read behavior,
          skip assumptions.)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Name what makes it matter.</strong> (Turn features into benefits
          and benefits into belief.)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Make it move.</strong> (Copy, comms, onboarding, whatever’s blocking
          adoption.)
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        I’ve worked in chaotic startup environments, launched without designers
        and built GTM plans off Miro boards and DMs. I’ve led marketing from “we
        haven’t launched yet” to “we need users who pay,” and I’ve done it with
        one tab open to PostHog and another to Figma.
      </p>

      <p>
        But what drives me most isn’t the stack — it’s the spark that happens
        when something finally clicks. When a founder hears their story the
        right way. When a product stops needing to explain itself. When users
        start showing up without being asked.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10">A little outside the browser:</h2>
      <p>
        I live in Islamabad with a head full of tabs and a to-do list that
        always includes “go outside”. I don’t always manage it — but when I do,
        you’ll find me walking tree-lined streets, writing through my phone
        notes or daydreaming about cities I haven’t met yet.
      </p>

      <p>
        Also: I’m deeply curious, permanently caffeinated and endlessly rooting
        for underdog ideas.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          Thanks for reading — now I’d love to learn about <em>you</em>.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-x-4">
          <a
            href="mailto:biaahmedy@gmail.com"
            class="inline-block text-sm font-semibold underline hover:text-theme-sun-primary dark:hover:text-theme-moon-primary transition"
          >
            biaahmedy@gmail.com
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://linkedin.com/in/biaahmed"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-block text-sm font-semibold underline hover:text-theme-sun-primary dark:hover:text-theme-moon-primary transition"
          >
            LinkedIn ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
